  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive and Sustainable Development of Tomato Value Chain in Egypt Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to support the tomato value chain in Egypt. the project 170251 strengthened the tomato value chain in Egypt by establishing a Tomato Learning and Service Center (TLSC). The center is now operational and works as a hub for training, education, value addition and product develoment, among others. This project will further strengthen the operation and management of TLSC for its sustainable development</narrative>
